ph-postal — data attribution
=============================

The bundled postal-code dataset (data/postal-codes-2024.json) is derived from
the GeoNames Philippines postal-code dump:

  https://download.geonames.org/export/zip/PH.zip

GeoNames data is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  © GeoNames — https://www.geonames.org

This package adds a derived `cityMunCode` join to the PSA Q4 2024 PSGC
cities/municipalities (via @ph-dev-utils/core) and excludes geography-less
institutional/PO-box ZIP codes. The transform is reproducible from
scripts/build-data.mjs over scripts/geonames-PH.txt.

ZIP data is community-sourced (GeoNames) and reconciled against the PHLPost
ZIP-code locator (https://phlpost.gov.ph). It is NOT an official PHLPost feed —
verify against PHLPost for authoritative, production-critical use.
